<title>USA: US spot MTBE weaker but firmer tone seen.</title>
<headline>US spot MTBE weaker but firmer tone seen.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spot MTBE prices were softer compared to last week but traders said on Thursday there was a firmer tone in the market amid a rise in feedstocks costs.</p>
<p>After finding what seemed to be a floor earlier this week, prices for normal butane, which is an MTBE feedstock, began to firm late yesterday and today due to petrochemical demand.</p>
<p>Feedstock methanol was also running high, players said.</p>
